@chapter Crate @code{math-optimisation}
@cindex math-optimisation
@cindex Differential Evolution
@cindex L-SHADE

@code{math-optimisation} is a pure-Rust non-linear optimisation
toolbox: Differential Evolution (including L-SHADE), Levenberg-
Marquardt, COBYLA and ISRES. It is the core solver behind AutoEQ
and RoomEQ.

